# Architectural Decision Records

Use this folder for consequential decisions: those whose cost of reversal grows with the code written against them, rather than staying flat.

Lighter, easily-reversible decisions belong in [../../decisions/](../../decisions/) instead.

If an ADR started life in [../../open/OPEN_DECISIONS.md](../../open/OPEN_DECISIONS.md), carry its ID into the new file's `origin` field so a citation made while it was open still resolves.

If undecided architectural questions start accumulating faster than they can be framed as ADRs, copy `templates-optional/docs/adr/ADR_CANDIDATES.md.tmpl` in as a design-phase backlog — most projects won't need it.

